==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel]'''}} invades the world of The Battle Cats! Log in to experience special stages and collect awesome content based on the worldwide hit anime!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Available Feb. 25th (11am) through March 11th, 2019 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●"Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel]" Rare Capsule Set'''}}<br>
The Masters and Servants of "Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel]" appear in the Battle Cats Rare Capsule Machine! This crossover set is only available during this event, so don't miss out on getting all 14 Collab Units!!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Edition Units Include:'''}}<br>
Sakura Matou (Uber Rare)<br>
Tough vs. Aliens, Zombies and Black Enemies, with Area Attack!<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Saber (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Massive damage vs. Floating, with Long-range Area attack!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Rin Tohsaka (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Chance to knockback Aliens and Zombies, with Area Attack!<br>
{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Illyasviel (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Chance to Slow Red and Metal enemies, with Area Attack!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Archer (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Immune to Wave Damage, with Long-range Area Attack!<br>
{{Color|#008000|'''Lancer (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
100% chance to break Barriers! (Area Attack)<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Rider (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Freezes Angels with Area Attacks!<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Gilgamesh (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Grows stronger after taking damage, with Long-range Area Attack!<br>
{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Kotomine & Gilgamesh Cats (Super Rare)'''}}<br>
Chance to weaken Black enemies, grows stronger after taking damage, with Area Attack!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Rare Cats: Sakura the Cat, Rin the Cat, Illya the Cat, Archer the Cat, Rider the Cat'''}}<br>
Collect all of the heroes of "Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel]", available only during this crossover event!<br>
<small><small>※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the "Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel]" collab units from the "Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel]" capsule set. "Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel]" units can not be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. Please make sure that you have selected the "Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel]" capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※If "Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel]" Collab Capsules fail to appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Collab Stages appear in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
A merciless battle for the ultimate prize! The Holy Grail War continues in the Legend Stages of The Battle Cats! Fight your favorite Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel] characters as tough enemy units!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Special Map: The Holy Grail War'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend Stories in Battle Cats to challenge a new map and Servant in the daily {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Holy Grail War'''}} series map!<br>
More difficult stages on this map grant a higher chance to collect Li'l Shirou as a drop reward. (Using a Treasure Radar provides a 100% chance to pick up the reward!)<br>
<small><small>※ You can activate Saber the Cat at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade Menu!</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・A Different Blitz Collab Map each day!'''}}<br>
High-difficulty Servant enemies stand in between your Cats and glory! Challenge the maps below to experience awesome Fate/stay night backgrounds, enemies and content! A new trial awaits you each day during this event!

{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Monday・・・Holy War: Saber'''<br>
'''Tuesday・・・Holy War: Lancer'''<br>
'''Wednesday・・・Holy War: Archer'''<br>
'''Thursday・・・Holy War: Rider'''<br>
'''Friday・・・Holy War: Gilgamesh'''<br>
'''All maps return as Blitz events on Weekends!'''}}

More difficult stages on these maps grant a higher chance to collect drop rewards. (Using a Treasure Radar provides a 100% chance to pick up the reward!)

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Blitz Stage! "Holy War: Saber Alter"'''}}<br>
The heroic knight falls to the forces of darkness! Can you withstand her power? Clear the stage for a chance to collect {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Saber the Cat's True Form!'''}}<br>
The blitz stage {{Color|#FF6D01|'''"Holy War: Saber Alter"'''}} will appear {{Color|#FF0000|'''March 2nd'''}} in The Battle Cats Legend Stories!<br>
More difficult stages on this map grant a higher chance to collect Saber the Cat's True Form as a drop reward. (Using a Treasure Radar provides a 100% chance to pick up the reward!)<br>
<small><small>※ Collect "Saber the Cat" as reward from your Day 3 Login Stamp!<br>
※ You can activate Saber the Cat at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade Menu!<br>
※ Saber the Cat may be upgraded to her True Form after reaching Level 20.<br>
※ If "Holy War: Saber Alter" is cleared before the character is collected, it is possible that you may unlock the True Form before the actual Cat Unit.</small></small>

Plus, get a {{Color|#FF00CC|'''first-time clear reward of 30 Cat Food'''}} when you achieve victory on all stages on any of these maps!<br>
<small><small>※If Collab Stages fail to appear, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●"Into the Fray: Servants Strike!" appears in the Arena of Honor'''}}<br>
Get your strongest soldiers of the Cat Army ready, a special "Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel]" Dojo Ranking Event is here and it's time to prove yourself! Select "Into the Fray: Servants Strike!" at the Catclaw Dojo and aim for the top score as you face off against powerful Servants from this limited collab event!<br>
Climb to the highest tiers of power as your scores are measured against all other Battle Cats players? Can you make it to the top 10%?<br>
Try as many times as you like before the event ends, and earn a special prize when your final high score determines your skill tier.<br>
Tap the Rewards List button to see what you might win as you climb the rankings!<br>
<small><small>※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Exiting the Battle screen during an Arena challenge will not restore spent Cat Food.<br>
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor.<br>
※ Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If the Arena of Honor does not appear even if the conditions are met, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special collab missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn delightful bonus rewards by playing limited-time-only Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel] events!<br>
<small><small>※Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel] Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until March 11th, 2018 at 11am. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Login each day for stamp rewards and a limited edition Cat Unit !'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign to pick up every stamp and get a Rare Ticket, battle items and other rewards! Plus, your third Login Stamp will unlock the {{Color|#008000|'''Special Collab Unit "Saber the Cat"'''}}<br>
Then, your seventh Login Stamp will unlock the next {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Special Collab Unit "Shirou the Cat"'''}}.<br>
Don't forget to login or you'll miss out!<br>
<small><small>※Once received, you can unlock "Saber the Cat" by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.</small></small>

For more information on "Fate/stay night [Heaven's Feel]", visit http://www.fate-sn.com/

